1
00:00:12,679 --> 00:00:13,679
Fan service

2
00:00:30,572 --> 00:00:31,406
Should we go with A set?

3
00:00:31,531 --> 00:00:32,866
Sure, anything's
fine for me

4
00:00:32,950 --> 00:00:34,093
But when is
the president coming?

5
00:00:34,117 --> 00:00:35,117
She's almost here

6
00:00:41,541 --> 00:00:42,376
Who is it?

7
00:00:42,460 --> 00:00:44,012
Ah, it's Soobin

8
00:00:44,586 --> 00:00:45,128
Look at this

9
00:00:45,212 --> 00:00:46,356
[I took it on my way home!]
I guess he's doing well

10
00:00:46,380 --> 00:00:47,548
Wow, that's cool

11
00:00:47,673 --> 00:00:48,673
Right?

12
00:00:50,968 --> 00:00:52,336
You must be starving

13
00:00:52,419 --> 00:00:53,178
Did you order
something?

14
00:00:53,303 --> 00:00:55,023
Yes, we ordered A set
The most expensive one

15
00:00:55,097 --> 00:00:56,556
Long time no see

16
00:00:56,640 --> 00:00:59,017
Congratulations!
You're on public TV now!

17
00:01:00,185 --> 00:01:01,353
Oh, don't say that…

18
00:01:02,437 --> 00:01:04,231
I'm feeling
pretty happy, though

19
00:01:04,356 --> 00:01:05,899
It feels like
I'm stepping up

20
00:01:06,024 --> 00:01:06,775
You did a great job

21
00:01:06,900 --> 00:01:08,274
Congratulations

22
00:01:08,819 --> 00:01:10,245
But, is that rumor
about Shin Yoo-il true?

23
00:01:10,269 --> 00:01:12,322
The contract
termination lawsuit…

24
00:01:12,859 --> 00:01:15,450
Why do you bring that up
all of a sudden?

25
00:01:16,493 --> 00:01:18,120
Can't we just talk
about that?

26
00:01:18,912 --> 00:01:20,205
Well…

27
00:01:20,330 --> 00:01:22,291
the penalty would be
quite a lot, right?

28
00:01:22,416 --> 00:01:24,442
It depends on
Shin Yoo-il's decision

29
00:01:24,793 --> 00:01:26,253
But President Goo
wouldn't want

30
00:01:26,336 --> 00:01:27,856
Shin Yoo-il to leave
the company either
